---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Scene from '../components/Scene.astro';
import FeaturedProject from '../components/FeaturedProject.astro';
import ContactCta from '../components/ContactCta.astro';
---
<Layout title="Aerospace Engineering — Salim Youssef Najim" description="Aerospace Engineering studies at Khalifa University, technical interests and student engineering work by Salim Youssef Najim.">
  <section class="page-hero section-pad">
    <div class="aero-intro">
      <div><p class="eyebrow section-index">Academic direction</p><h1>Aerospace<br/><span>Engineering.</span></h1><p class="lead">My academic path at Khalifa University. A foundation in flight, physics and the systems that bring them together.</p><dl class="page-facts"><div><dt>University</dt><dd>Khalifa University</dd></div><div><dt>Discipline</dt><dd>Aerospace Engineering</dd></div></dl></div>
      <Scene variant="lab" interactive class="aero-scene"/>
    </div>
    <div class="lab-caption"><p class="eyebrow">Use the controls to explore</p><p class="eyebrow">Illustrative turbine study</p></div>
  </section>
  <section class="focus-section section-pad">
    <div class="section-heading reveal"><div><p class="eyebrow section-index">Technical perspective</p><h2>Areas of interest.</h2></div><p>The component, the conditions around it and its place in the larger system.</p></div>
    <div class="focus-grid">
      <article class="focus-item reveal"><p class="eyebrow">01 / Flight</p><svg class="schematic-mini" viewBox="0 0 80 80" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m7 55 59-32-24 32H7Z" stroke="currentColor"/><path d="M12 30h30M6 37h25M8 44h13m33 18V9m-5 6 5-6 5 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity=".45"/></svg><h3>Form & motion.</h3><p>The relationship between an aircraft’s shape, its movement and the conditions around it.</p></article>
      <article class="focus-item reveal"><p class="eyebrow">02 / Energy</p><svg class="schematic-mini" viewBox="0 0 80 80" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="40" cy="40" r="26" stroke="currentColor"/><path d="m43 15-15 28h15l-5 22 17-31H40l3-19Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity=".5"/></svg><h3>Capture & transfer.</h3><p>How energy is captured, stored and moved through a system, and what is lost along the way.</p></article>
      <article class="focus-item reveal"><p class="eyebrow">03 / Systems</p><svg class="schematic-mini" viewBox="0 0 80 80" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 12h22v22H8zM50 46h22v22H50z" stroke="currentColor"/><path d="M30 23h32v23M19 34v23h31" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity=".5"/><circle cx="42" cy="23" r="3" fill="currentColor"/></svg><h3>Parts & connections.</h3><p>How individual engineering choices affect the behavior of the whole.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="project-intro section-pad reveal"><p class="eyebrow section-index">Related engineering work</p><h2>Systems thinking<br/>in practice.</h2><p>LUMOS applies that perspective to a student sustainable-energy concept, linking generation, storage and illumination.</p></section>
  <FeaturedProject/>
  <ContactCta/>
</Layout>
